{"id":"en_dubbed-baby-s-whisper-family-armor","title":"(Dubbed) Baby's Whisper, Family Armor","titleEn":"(Dubbed) Baby's Whisper, Family Armor","description":"After mocking a short drama, Vivian finds herself transmigrated into it as an infant. The Shaw family takes her in, and they soon discover they can hear her thoughts. Through those thoughts, she exposes the truth about their adopted daughter Mandy, whose sweet demeanor hides a secret campaign to drain the family's luck. Guided by Vivian's foreknowledge, the Shaws anticipate and thwart each of Mandy's plots. Mandy ultimately disappears, undone by the backlash of her own schemes, while the Shaw family goes on to prosper.","poster":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/dubbed-babys-whisper-family-armor/en_US/a07426ca32bd65ac/cover.webp","backdrop":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/dubbed-babys-whisper-family-armor/en_US/a07426ca32bd65ac/cover.webp","kind":"series","year":2025,"genres":["Fantasy","Karma Payback","Life OL","Short Drama"],"featured":false,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7ds780/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}],"episodes":[{"id":"ep_dubbed-baby-s-whisper-family-armor_1","title":"Episode 1","season":1,"number":1,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7ds780/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_dubbed-baby-s-whisper-family-armor_2","title":"Episode 2","season":1,"number":2,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7ds780/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_dubbed-baby-s-whisper-family-armor_3","title":"Episode 3","season":1,"number":3,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7ds780/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_dubbed-baby-s-whisper-family-armor_4","title":"Episode 4","season":1,"number":4,"sources":[{"id":"ru